 	                             bool shouldJustDeleteNodes = false);
+	/// mastertune-v16: whether the row's expression is a drone row's Hz lane (DroneDrum), which its notes (the gate)
+	/// don't carry: notes added, recorded, deleted, moved to another row or made Euclidean leave it as it is, and no
+	/// note's MPE goes into it
